# SSOT: the Kubernetes node image every local kind cluster in this repo runs.
#
# Sourced by every `kind create cluster` (scripts/setup.sh, test/rulepack-e2e/run.sh),
# which pass it as `--image`. Without an explicit image, the cluster's Kubernetes
# version is whatever the installed kind binary defaults to, so it moves silently
# when kind is upgraded.
#
# Other pins follow this one and tests/shared/test_toolchain_pin_parity.py holds
# them to it: the devcontainer kubectl (within one minor of this version, per the
# Kubernetes version-skew policy).
#
# Digest-pinned: a kindest/node tag can be re-pushed. To bump, take the image
# listed in the release notes of the kind version pinned in
# .devcontainer/devcontainer.json (postCreateCommand), or a newer one built for
# that kind release.
KIND_NODE_IMAGE=kindest/node:v1.37.0@sha256:a1ed56cfb0e7b93589bdf97c8cd566405a265939e3620fc4f5de89adff580ae5
